sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/run/species-area-exponent--claude-opus-5-5--2--2026-11-01> a prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "Run of approach species-area-exponent--claude-opus-5-5--2 (2026-11-01): partial, did not settle its target" ;
    dct:description "The Coleman random-placement null was computed on 1,618 feasible grid cells (lognormal, log-series and Preston canonical pools): median null z 0.134, 5th to 95th percentile 0 to 0.925, 7.0% of cells in [0.20, 0.30]; total abundance J explains 79% of the null variance. The comparison with observed exponents was not run: the Triantis, Guilhaumon and Whittaker 2012 compilation is closed and no open copy was found. Claim-level verdict inconclusive (data-unavailable). The approach's own failure signature holds: with J free the null sits almost anywhere in (0, 1), so it does not discriminate." ;

    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/problem/species-area-exponent> ;
    prov:qualifiedAssociation <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/run/species-area-exponent--claude-opus-5-5--2--2026-11-01#plan> ;
